                <pb facs="1091" n="1011" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg1011"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr. Eddy.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-10-23"><hi rendition="#italic">October 23,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Adee states that $2,000 additional have been received, making a total of
                    $66,000 available for the ransom of Miss Stone.)</p>
            </div>
